&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analytics Intern at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of international innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This dual-location role is all about driving impact. You&#39;ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that redefine the grocery shopping experience across Europe. Throughout this year-long program, you’ll exchange between two locations &lt;strong&gt;Paris (6 months) &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam (6 months)&lt;/strong&gt;, gaining cross-market perspectives in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status-quo. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
